Lets llama.cpp load a qwen3vl output head smaller than the vocabulary, as
Qwen3-ForcedAligner's 5000 timestamp classes: the change proposed in
https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/32127 (cmake/third_party.cmake
applies it to the submodule).

